Icing hit the wall. Bok

15
00:01:38.803 --> 00:01:43.422
Choy looked up. "You're

16
00:01:43.423 --> 00:01:48.328
making a mess!" "We'll

17
00:01:48.329 --> 00:01:52.543
clean up later," Cupcake said. She

18
00:01:52.544 --> 00:01:58.900
and Berry danced some more. Bok

19
00:01:58.901 --> 00:02:07.351
Choy sighed. He

20
00:02:07.352 --> 00:02:18.190
read more of his book. Bok

21
